@startuml
title C1 — SO31 / CO31 Import CSV
skinparam shadowing false
actor "Administrative Staff" as Staff
participant ":AppointmentTrackingSystem" as System
Staff -> System : importCsv(sourceFile, kind)
alt unreadable/invalid path, UTF-8, CSV structure or headers
  System --> Staff : file error; zero records imported
else readable file and valid structure/headers
  alt all data rows valid (possibly duplicate or zero rows)
    System --> Staff : imported/skipped counts and new-object counts
  else one or more invalid data rows
    System --> Staff : imported/skipped/rejected counts; record error messages
  end
end
note over Staff, System
  kind: AVAILABILITY, APPOINTMENTS, WAITLIST_PATIENTS.
  Normal order: availability, appointments, waitlist information.
  Valid rows are retained when another data row fails.
  Extended BOOKED availability rows include patient identity.
  Waitlist descriptions alone create no eligible entry or Referral.
end note
@enduml
